{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02494",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.15,
      "end_seconds": 8.02,
      "duration_seconds": 6.87,
      "text": "Doctor, hi, where would you like me to put my coat?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.58,
      "end_seconds": 13.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.45,
      "text": "yes, have a seat. Tell me what's going on"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.01,
      "end_seconds": 24.91,
      "duration_seconds": 10.9,
      "text": "I'm here because of ringing in the left ear. I looked a few things up online, and that probably didn't help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.97,
      "end_seconds": 29.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "so, did it come on recently?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 34.29,
      "end_seconds": 38.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "It's been going on for four weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.01,
      "end_seconds": 41.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "how frequently does it come?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 42.12,
      "end_seconds": 53.12,
      "duration_seconds": 11.0,
      "text": "I'd say once or twice a day. I've also had hearing getting worse. As for hearing getting worse, I'd call it severe."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 54.94,
      "end_seconds": 62.01,
      "duration_seconds": 7.07,
      "text": "have you had ringing in the left ear before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.73,
      "end_seconds": 68.26,
      "duration_seconds": 5.53,
      "text": "A bit, last year. It settled by itself back then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 79.43,
      "end_seconds": 82.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "Time for your numbers, if that's okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 93.07,
      "end_seconds": 95.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "That's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 105.62,
      "end_seconds": 115.14,
      "duration_seconds": 9.52,
      "text": "Okay: temp 36.4 degrees, pulse is 67 beats a minute, blood pressure 109 over 78. And respiratory rate 15, saturation 99 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.85,
      "end_seconds": 121.98,
      "duration_seconds": 4.13,
      "text": "Let me look at the area, I'll be gentle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.2,
      "end_seconds": 124.41,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21,
      "text": "Does that hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.43,
      "end_seconds": 145.19,
      "duration_seconds": 5.76,
      "text": "The ear drums look normal and the hearing is reduced on the left."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.37,
      "end_seconds": 150.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "That's all I needed to check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 159.96,
      "end_seconds": 163.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "And what about double vision, headache or weakness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 164.47,
      "end_seconds": 168.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "I mean, nope, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.93,
      "end_seconds": 170.37,
      "duration_seconds": 1.44,
      "text": "Any ear discharge?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.36,
      "end_seconds": 173.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "Nope, no ear discharge."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.1,
      "end_seconds": 178.12,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "On the cardiac side, anything I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 179.63,
      "end_seconds": 181.44,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "Nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.19,
      "end_seconds": 187.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "Anything you do to to stay fit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 188.51,
      "end_seconds": 192.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "I do a yoga class on Thursdays."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 192.96,
      "end_seconds": 195.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "Do you follow any particular diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 196.96,
      "end_seconds": 200.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.39,
      "end_seconds": 204.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "do you live by yourself?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 206.33,
      "end_seconds": 210.51,
      "duration_seconds": 4.18,
      "text": "No, I share a house with my brother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.22,
      "end_seconds": 216.88,
      "duration_seconds": 4.66,
      "text": "Can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 218.87,
      "end_seconds": 224.19,
      "duration_seconds": 5.32,
      "text": "So, I'm on warfarin, 3 milligrams, in the evening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.87,
      "end_seconds": 228.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Since when have you been taking it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 234.57,
      "end_seconds": 236.1,
      "duration_seconds": 1.53,
      "text": "Two years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.36,
      "end_seconds": 239.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "do you have any chronic illnesses?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 240.82,
      "end_seconds": 247.1,
      "duration_seconds": 6.28,
      "text": "Ah, I've had an irregular heartbeat for about a year now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.76,
      "end_seconds": 253.95,
      "duration_seconds": 5.19,
      "text": "Has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 254.58,
      "end_seconds": 257.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "Not to my knowledge, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.75,
      "end_seconds": 291.3,
      "duration_seconds": 20.55,
      "text": "Let me tell you where I've got to. My working impression is Meniere's disease. I can't rule out vestibular migraine yet. I think a hearing test makes sense here, for vertigo and hearing loss. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 292.83,
      "end_seconds": 295.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "Right, um, understood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 295.67,
      "end_seconds": 315.29,
      "duration_seconds": 19.62,
      "text": "I'm going to put you on betahistine, 16 milligrams, three times a day, long term. It's for vertigo. Cut down on salt and caffeine. Cut back on tea, coffee and fizzy drinks for a couple of weeks and see how things settle. Come back in six weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 317.21,
      "end_seconds": 320.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "actually, alright, I'll be back"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 322.29,
      "end_seconds": 325.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 330.1,
      "end_seconds": 333.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "Alright, uh, thanks, take care."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 334.81,
      "end_seconds": 336.44,
      "duration_seconds": 1.63,
      "text": "Have a good day."
    }
  ]
}